The disabled Help & Credits Home button is the only Home navigation feature intentionally made unavailable.

16. Cleanup

After implementing:

* Remove unused road CSS.
* Remove unused road DOM.
* Remove unused Home imports.
* Remove obsolete Home header CSS if nothing else uses it.
* Remove obsolete .home-eyebrow, .home-build, .home-road* rules.
* Adjust Home entrance-animation selectors so removed elements do not leave incorrect nth-child() timing assumptions.
* Ensure there are no console errors.
* Do not introduce dependencies or a build system.

Acceptance criteria

The change is complete only when all of the following are true:

* The large ALVA wordmark is visibly farther left and its first visible stroke aligns with the start of Fan project. Big heart.
* The tagline is exactly Fan project. Big heart.
* 2D sprite fighting game is gone from the visible Home UI.
* The small top-left ALVA mark is gone.
* The top-right Build label is gone.
* Help & Credits remains visible but is disabled and cannot be selected or activated.
* The road and all lane graphics are completely gone.
* A gray/charcoal credits region occupies the former right-side visual area.
* A green line cleanly separates the menu and credits regions.
* Credits automatically scroll upward and restart indefinitely.
* Reduced-motion users receive a non-animated readable version.
* Home bottom-right keyboard/control hints are gone.
* by hiyroscript remains.
* No user-facing runtime text contains Naruto or Uzumaki.
* Jump Ultimate Stars / Nintendo / The Spriters Resource / Dazz / FRET attribution remains appropriately represented.
* #0001 sprite assets are untouched.
* Play still works.
* Pause-menu Help still works.
* Desktop and landscape mobile layouts remain usable.
* There are no JavaScript errors or layout overflow regressions.

Implement this as a focused Home/credits redesign rather than a broader restyling of the game.
